          "context": "In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires,— (a) “Appellate Tribunal” means the Telecom Disputes Settlement and Appellate Tribunal established under section 14 of the Telecom Regulatory Authority of India Act, 1997;"
        },
        {
          "referenceKind": "section",
