      "marker": "(3)",
      "markerToken": "3",
      "depth": 1,
      "order": 2,
      "sourceText": "The Chairperson and other Members shall be a person of ability, integrity and\nstanding who possesses special knowledge or practical experience in the fields of data\ngovernance, administration or implementation of laws related to social or consumer\nprotection, dispute resolution, information and communication technology, digital economy,\nlaw, regulation or techno-regulation, or in any other field which in the opinion of the Central\nGovernment may be useful to the Board, and at least one among them shall be an expert in\nthe field of law.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "act:section:20",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-act-2023",
      "parent": "act:chapter:v",
      "provisionLevel": "section",
      "sectionNumber": 20,
      "title": "Salary, allowances payable to and term of office",
      "sourcePages": {
        "start": 12,
        "end": null
      },
      "extractedSourceText": "20. (1) The salary, allowances and other terms and conditions of service of the\nChairperson and other Members shall be such as may be prescribed, and shall not be varied\nto their disadvantage after their appointment.\n(2) The Chairperson and other Members shall hold office for a term of two years and\nshall be eligible for re-appointment.",
      "bodyText": "(1) The salary, allowances and other terms and conditions of service of the\nChairperson and other Members shall be such as may be prescribed, and shall not be varied\nto their disadvantage after their appointment.\n(2) The Chairperson and other Members shall hold office for a term of two years and\nshall be eligible for re-appointment.",
      "leadInText": "",
      "textStatus": "PDF-extracted; Gazette PDF remains authoritative",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "act:section:20:subsection:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
