      "marker": "(b)",
      "markerToken": "b",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 3,
      "sourceText": "any defect in the appointment of a person acting as the Chairperson or other\nMember of the Board; or",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "act:section:23:subsection:2:clause:c",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-act-2023",
      "parent": "act:section:23:subsection:2",
      "rootProvision": "act:section:23",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(c)",
      "markerToken": "c",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 4,
      "sourceText": "any irregularity in the procedure of the Board, which does not affect the\nmerits of the case.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "act:section:23:subsection:3",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-act-2023",
      "parent": "act:section:23",
      "rootProvision": "act:section:23",
      "provisionLevel": "subsection",
      "marker": "(3)",
      "markerToken": "3",
      "depth": 1,
      "order": 5,
      "sourceText": "When the Chairperson is unable to discharge her functions owing to absence,\nillness or any other cause, the senior-most Member shall discharge the functions of the\nChairperson until the date on which the Chairperson resumes her duties.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "act:section:24",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-act-2023",
      "parent": "act:chapter:v",
      "provisionLevel": "section",
      "sectionNumber": 24,
      "title": "Officers and employees of Board",
      "sourcePages": {
        "start": 13,
        "end": 13
      },
      "extractedSourceText": "24. The Board may, with previous approval of the Central Government, appoint such\nofficers and employees as it may deem necessary for the efficient discharge of its functions\nunder the provisions of this Act, on such terms and conditions of appointment and service\nas may be prescribed.",
      "bodyText": "The Board may, with previous approval of the Central Government, appoint such\nofficers and employees as it may deem necessary for the efficient discharge of its functions\nunder the provisions of this Act, on such terms and conditions of appointment and service\nas may be prescribed.",
      "leadInText": "The Board may, with previous approval of the Central Government, appoint such officers and employees as it may deem necessary for the efficient discharge of its functions under the provisions of this Act, on such terms and conditions of appointment and service as may be prescribed.",
      "textStatus": "PDF-extracted; Gazette PDF remains authoritative",
