    {
      "@id": "act:section:26",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-act-2023",
      "parent": "act:chapter:v",
      "provisionLevel": "section",
      "sectionNumber": 26,
      "title": "Powers of Chairperson",
      "sourcePages": {
        "start": 14,
        "end": 14
      },
      "extractedSourceText": "26. The Chairperson shall exercise the following powers, namely:—\n(a) general superintendence and giving direction in respect of all administrative\nmatters of the Board;\n(b) authorise any officer of the Board to scrutinise any intimation, complaint,\nreference or correspondence addressed to the Board; and\n(c) authorise performance of any of the functions of the Board and conduct any\nof its proceedings, by an individual Member or groups of Members and to allocate\nproceedings among them.\nCHAPTER VI\nPOWERS, FUNCTIONS AND PROCEDURE TO BE FOLLOWED BY BOARD",
      "bodyText": "The Chairperson shall exercise the following powers, namely:—\n(a) general superintendence and giving direction in respect of all administrative\nmatters of the Board;\n(b) authorise any officer of the Board to scrutinise any intimation, complaint,\nreference or correspondence addressed to the Board; and\n(c) authorise performance of any of the functions of the Board and conduct any\nof its proceedings, by an individual Member or groups of Members and to allocate\nproceedings among them.",
      "leadInText": "The Chairperson shall exercise the following powers, namely:—",
      "textStatus": "PDF-extracted; Gazette PDF remains authoritative",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
