      "sourceText": "If the Board is of the opinion that a Consent Manager is not adhering to the conditions and obligations\nunder this rule,it may, after giving an opportunity of being heard, inform the Consent Manager of such non-\nadherence and direct the Consent Manager to take measures to ensure adherence.",
