      "sourceText": "shall function as a digital office which, without prejudice to its power to summon and enforce the\nattendance of any person and examine her on oath, may adopt techno -legal measures to conduct\nproceedings in a manner that does not require physical presence of any individual.",
      "crossReferences": []
