      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall maintain on its platform a record of the following, namely:—\n(a) Consents given, denied or withdrawn by her;\n(b) Notices preceding or accompanying requests for consent; and\n(c) Sharing of her personal data with a transferee Data Fiduciary.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall maintain on its platform a record of the following, namely:—\n(a) Consents given, denied or withdrawn by her;\n(b) Notices preceding or accompanying requests for consent; and\n(c) Sharing of her personal data with a transferee Data Fiduciary.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 4,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager: —\n(a) shall give the Data Principal using such platform access to such record;\n(b) shall, on the request of the Data Principal and in accordance with its terms of service, make\navailable to her the information contained in such record, in machine-readable form; and\n(c) shall maintain such record for at least seven years, or for such longer period as the Data\nPrincipal and Consent Manager may agree upon or as may be required by law.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager: —\n(a) shall give the Data Principal using such platform access to such record;\n(b) shall, on the request of the Data Principal and in accordance with its terms of service, make\navailable to her the information contained in such record, in machine-readable form; and\n(c) shall maintain such record for at least seven years, or for such longer period as the Data\nPrincipal and Consent Manager may agree upon or as may be required by law.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:5",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 5,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall develop and maintain a website or app, or both, as the primary means\nthrough which a Data Principal may access the services provided by the Consent Manager.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall develop and maintain a website or app, or both, as the primary means\nthrough which a Data Principal may access the services provided by the Consent Manager.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:6",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 6,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall not sub -contract or assign the performance of any of its obligations under\nthe Act and these rules.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall not sub -contract or assign the performance of any of its obligations under\nthe Act and these rules.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:7",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 7,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall take reasonable security safeguards to prevent personal data breach.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall take reasonable security safeguards to prevent personal data breach.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:8",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 8,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall act in a fiduciary capacity in relation to the Data Principal.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall act in a fiduciary capacity in relation to the Data Principal.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:9",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 9,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall avoid conflict of interest with Data Fiduciaries, including in respect of\ntheir promoters and key managerial personnel.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall avoid conflict of interest with Data Fiduciaries, including in respect of\ntheir promoters and key managerial personnel.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 10,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall have in place measures to ensure that no conflict of interest arises on\naccount of its directors, key managerial personnel and senior management holding a directorship, financial\ninterest, employment or beneficial ownership in Data Fiduciaries, or having a material pecuniary\nrelationship with them.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall have in place measures to ensure that no conflict of interest arises on\naccount of its directors, key managerial personnel and senior management holding a directorship, financial\ninterest, employment or beneficial ownership in Data Fiduciaries, or having a material pecuniary\nrelationship with them.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 11,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall publish in an easily accessible manner, on its website or app, or both, as\nthe case may be, information regarding: —\n(a) the promoters, directors, key managerial personnel and senior management of the company\nregistered as Consent Manager;\n(b) every person who holds shares in excess of two per cent . of the shareholding of the company\nregistered as Consent Manager;\n(c) everybody corporate in whose shareholding any promoter, director, key managerial personnel or\nsenior management of the Consent Manager holds shares in excess of two per cent. as on the\nfirst day of the preceding calendar month; and\n(d) such other information as the Board may direct the Consent Manager to disclose in the interests\nof transparency.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall publish in an easily accessible manner, on its website or app, or both, as\nthe case may be, information regarding: —\n(a) the promoters, directors, key managerial personnel and senior management of the company\nregistered as Consent Manager;\n(b) every person who holds shares in excess of two per cent . of the shareholding of the company\nregistered as Consent Manager;\n(c) everybody corporate in whose shareholding any promoter, director, key managerial personnel or\nsenior management of the Consent Manager holds shares in excess of two per cent. as on the\nfirst day of the preceding calendar month; and\n(d) such other information as the Board may direct the Consent Manager to disclose in the interests\nof transparency.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 12,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall have in place effective audit mechanisms to review, monitor, evaluate and\nreport the outcome of such audit to the Board, periodically and on such other occasions as the Board may\ndirect, in respect of—\n(a) technical and organisational controls, systems, procedures and safeguards;\n(b) continued fulfilment of the conditions of registration; and\n(c) adherence to its obligations under the Act and these rules.",
      "extractedItemText": "The Consent Manager shall have in place effective audit mechanisms to review, monitor, evaluate and\nreport the outcome of such audit to the Board, periodically and on such other occasions as the Board may\ndirect, in respect of—\n(a) technical and organisational controls, systems, procedures and safeguards;\n(b) continued fulfilment of the conditions of registration; and\n(c) adherence to its obligations under the Act and these rules.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:13",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleItem",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b",
      "itemNumber": 13,
      "title": null,
      "sourceText": "The control of the company registered as the Consent Manager shall not be transferred by way of sale,\nmerger or otherwise, except with the previous approval of the Board and subject to fulfilment of such\nconditions as the Board may specify in this behalf.",
      "extractedItemText": "The control of the company registered as the Consent Manager shall not be transferred by way of sale,\nmerger or otherwise, except with the previous approval of the Board and subject to fulfilment of such\nconditions as the Board may specify in this behalf.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall enable a Data Principal using its platform to give consent to the",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1",
      "sourceText": "processing of her personal data by a Data Fiduciary onboarded onto such platform either directly to such",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1:unstructured:3",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1",
      "sourceText": "Data Fiduciary or through another Data Fiduciary onboarded onto such platform, who maintains such",
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1:unstructured:4",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1",
      "sourceText": "personal data with the consent of that Data Principal.",
      "order": 3
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1:illustration:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:Illustration",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:1",
      "sourceText": "Individuals are enabled to give, manage, review and withdraw their consent to the processing of\ntheir personal data through P, a platform maintained by a Consent Manager. X, an individual, is a registered\nuser on P. B1 and B2 are banks onboarded onto P.\nCase 1: B1 sends a request on P to X for consent to process personal data contained in her bank\naccount statement. X maintains the bank account statement as a digital record in her digital locker. X uses P\nto directly give her consent to B1, and proceeds to give B1 access to her bank account statement.\nCase 2: B1 sends a request on P to X for consent to process personal data contained in her bank\naccount statement. X maintains her bank account with B2. X uses P to route her consent through B2 to B1,\nwhile also digitally instructing B2 to send her bank account statement to B1. B2 proceeds to send the bank\naccount statement to B1.",
      "order": 4
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:2:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:2",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall ensure that the manner of making available the personal data or its sharing",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:2:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:2",
      "sourceText": "is such that the contents thereof are not readable by it.",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3:clause:a",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(a)",
      "markerToken": "a",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 1,
      "sourceText": "Consents given, denied or withdrawn by her;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3:clause:b",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(b)",
      "markerToken": "b",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "sourceText": "Notices preceding or accompanying requests for consent; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3:clause:c",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(c)",
      "markerToken": "c",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 3,
      "sourceText": "Sharing of her personal data with a transferee Data Fiduciary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:3",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall maintain on its platform a record of the following, namely:—",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4:clause:a",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(a)",
      "markerToken": "a",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 1,
      "sourceText": "shall give the Data Principal using such platform access to such record;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4:clause:b",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(b)",
      "markerToken": "b",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "sourceText": "shall, on the request of the Data Principal and in accordance with its terms of service, make\navailable to her the information contained in such record, in machine-readable form; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4:clause:c",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(c)",
      "markerToken": "c",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 3,
      "sourceText": "shall maintain such record for at least seven years, or for such longer period as the Data\nPrincipal and Consent Manager may agree upon or as may be required by law."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:4",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager: —",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:5:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:5",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall develop and maintain a website or app, or both, as the primary means",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:5:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:5",
      "sourceText": "through which a Data Principal may access the services provided by the Consent Manager.",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:6:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:6",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall not sub -contract or assign the performance of any of its obligations under",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:6:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:6",
      "sourceText": "the Act and these rules.",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:7:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:7",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall take reasonable security safeguards to prevent personal data breach.",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:8:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:8",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall act in a fiduciary capacity in relation to the Data Principal.",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:9:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:9",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall avoid conflict of interest with Data Fiduciaries, including in respect of",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:9:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:9",
      "sourceText": "their promoters and key managerial personnel.",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall have in place measures to ensure that no conflict of interest arises on",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10",
      "sourceText": "account of its directors, key managerial personnel and senior management holding a directorship, financial",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10:unstructured:3",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10",
      "sourceText": "interest, employment or beneficial ownership in Data Fiduciaries, or having a material pecuniary",
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10:unstructured:4",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10",
      "sourceText": "relationship with them.",
      "order": 3
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11:clause:a",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(a)",
      "markerToken": "a",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "sourceText": "the promoters, directors, key managerial personnel and senior management of the company\nregistered as Consent Manager;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11:clause:b",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(b)",
      "markerToken": "b",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 3,
      "sourceText": "every person who holds shares in excess of two per cent . of the shareholding of the company\nregistered as Consent Manager;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11:clause:c",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(c)",
      "markerToken": "c",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 4,
      "sourceText": "everybody corporate in whose shareholding any promoter, director, key managerial personnel or\nsenior management of the Consent Manager holds shares in excess of two per cent. as on the\nfirst day of the preceding calendar month; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11:clause:d",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(d)",
      "markerToken": "d",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 5,
      "sourceText": "such other information as the Board may direct the Consent Manager to disclose in the interests\nof transparency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall publish in an easily accessible manner, on its website or app, or both, as",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11",
      "sourceText": "the case may be, information regarding: —",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12:clause:a",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(a)",
      "markerToken": "a",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 3,
      "sourceText": "technical and organisational controls, systems, procedures and safeguards;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12:clause:b",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(b)",
      "markerToken": "b",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 4,
      "sourceText": "continued fulfilment of the conditions of registration; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12:clause:c",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(c)",
      "markerToken": "c",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 5,
      "sourceText": "adherence to its obligations under the Act and these rules."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall have in place effective audit mechanisms to review, monitor, evaluate and",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "sourceText": "report the outcome of such audit to the Board, periodically and on such other occasions as the Board may",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12:unstructured:3",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:12",
      "sourceText": "direct, in respect of—",
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:13:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:13",
      "sourceText": "The control of the company registered as the Consent Manager shall not be transferred by way of sale,",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:13:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:13",
      "sourceText": "merger or otherwise, except with the previous approval of the Board and subject to fulfilment of such",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:13:unstructured:3",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:13",
      "sourceText": "conditions as the Board may specify in this behalf.",
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "@type": "dpdp:Interpretation",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first",
      "sourceText": "Note: In this Schedule, —\n(a) the expression “body corporate” shall include a company, a body corporate as defined under\nclause (11) of section 2 of the Companies Act, 2013 (18 of 2013), a firm, a financial institution,\na scheduled bank or a public sector enterprise established or constituted by or under any Central\nAct, Provincial Act or State Act, and any other incorporated association of persons or body of\nindividuals;\n(b) the expressions “company”, “control”, “director” and “key managerial personnel” shall have the\nsame meanings as are respectively assigned to them in the Companies Act, 2013 (18 of 2013);\n(c) the expression “net worth” shall mean the aggregate value of total assets as reduced by the value\nof liabilities of the Consent Manager as appearing in its books of accounts; and\n(d) the expressions “promoter” and “senior management” shall have the same meanings as are\nrespectively assigned to them in the Companies Act, 2013 (18 or 2013)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:note:clause:a",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(a)",
      "markerToken": "a",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 1,
      "sourceText": "the expression “body corporate” shall include a company, a body corporate as defined under\nclause (11) of section 2 of the Companies Act, 2013 (18 of 2013), a firm, a financial institution,\na scheduled bank or a public sector enterprise established or constituted by or under any Central\nAct, Provincial Act or State Act, and any other incorporated association of persons or body of\nindividuals;",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:note:clause:b",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(b)",
      "markerToken": "b",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "sourceText": "the expressions “company”, “control”, “director” and “key managerial personnel” shall have the\nsame meanings as are respectively assigned to them in the Companies Act, 2013 (18 of 2013);",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:note:clause:c",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(c)",
      "markerToken": "c",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 3,
      "sourceText": "the expression “net worth” shall mean the aggregate value of total assets as reduced by the value\nof liabilities of the Consent Manager as appearing in its books of accounts; and",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:note:clause:d",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:first:note",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(d)",
      "markerToken": "d",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 4,
      "sourceText": "the expressions “promoter” and “senior management” shall have the same meanings as are\nrespectively assigned to them in the Companies Act, 2013 (18 or 2013).",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:a",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(a)",
      "markerToken": "a",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "sourceText": "Processing is carried out in a lawful manner;",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:b",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(b)",
      "markerToken": "b",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 3,
      "sourceText": "Processing is done for the uses specified in clause (b) of section 7 of the Act or for the purposes\nspecified in clause (b) of sub-section (2) of section 17 of the Act, as the case may be;",
      "crossReferences": [
        {
          "referenceKind": "section",
          "sourcePhrase": "section 7",
          "targetDocument": "doc:dpdp-act-2023",
          "target": "act:section:7",
          "resolutionStatus": "internal-resolved-root",
          "context": "Processing is done for the uses specified in clause (b) of section 7 of the Act or for the purposes specified in clause (b) of sub-section (2) of section 17 of the Act, as the case may be;"
        },
        {
          "referenceKind": "section",
          "sourcePhrase": "section 17",
          "targetDocument": "doc:dpdp-act-2023",
          "target": "act:section:17",
          "resolutionStatus": "internal-resolved-root",
          "context": "Processing is done for the uses specified in clause (b) of section 7 of the Act or for the purposes specified in clause (b) of sub-section (2) of section 17 of the Act, as the case may be;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:c",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(c)",
      "markerToken": "c",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 4,
      "sourceText": "Processing is limited to such personal data as is necessary for such uses or achieving such\npurposes, as the case may be;",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:d",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(d)",
      "markerToken": "d",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 5,
      "sourceText": "Processing is done while making reasonable efforts to ensure the completeness, accuracy and\nconsistency of personal data;",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:e",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(e)",
      "markerToken": "e",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 6,
      "sourceText": "Personal data is retained till required for such uses or achieving such purposes, as the case may\nbe, or for compliance with any law for the time being in force;",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:f",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(f)",
      "markerToken": "f",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 7,
      "sourceText": "Reasonable security safeguards to prevent personal data breach to protect personal data in the\npossession or under control of the Data Fiduciary, including in respect of any processing\nundertaken by it or on its behalf by a Data Processor;",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:g",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(g)",
      "markerToken": "g",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 8,
      "sourceText": "Where processing is to be done under clause (b) of section 7 of the Act, the same is undertaken\nwhile giving the Data Principal an intimation in respect of the same and—",
      "crossReferences": [
        {
          "referenceKind": "section",
          "sourcePhrase": "section 7",
          "targetDocument": "doc:dpdp-act-2023",
          "target": "act:section:7",
          "resolutionStatus": "internal-resolved-root",
          "context": "Where processing is to be done under clause (b) of section 7 of the Act, the same is undertaken while giving the Data Principal an intimation in respect of the same and—"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:g:subclause:i",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second:clause:g",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "subclause",
      "marker": "(i)",
      "markerToken": "i",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 9,
      "sourceText": "giving the business contact information of a person who is able to answer on behalf of\nthe Data Fiduciary the questions of the Data Principal about the processing of her\npersonal data;",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:g:subclause:ii",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second:clause:g",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "subclause",
      "marker": "(ii)",
      "markerToken": "ii",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 10,
      "sourceText": "specifying the particular communication link for accessing the website or app, or both,\nof such Data Fiduciary, and a description of other means, if any, using which such Data\nPrincipal may exercise her rights under the Act; and",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:g:subclause:iii",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second:clause:g",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "subclause",
      "marker": "(iii)",
      "markerToken": "iii",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 11,
      "sourceText": "is carried on in a manner consistent with such other standards as may be applicable to\nthe processing of such personal data under policy issued by the Central Government or\nany law for the time being in force; and",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:clause:h",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:second",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(h)",
      "markerToken": "h",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 12,
      "sourceText": "Accountability of the person who alone or in conjunction with other persons determines the\npurpose and means of processing of personal data, for effective observance of these standards.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:unstructured:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "sourceText": "Implementation of appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure effective observance of the",
      "order": 0
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:second:unstructured:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:TextBlock",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:second",
      "sourceText": "following, in accordance with applicable law, for the processing of personal data, namely: —",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:row:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleRow",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third",
      "rowNumber": 1,
      "dataFiduciaryClass": "Data Fiduciary who\nis an e-commerce\nentity having not\nless than two crore\nregistered users in\nIndia.",
      "purposeScope": "For all purposes, except for the following:\n(a) Enabling the Data Principal to access\nher user account; and\n(b) Enabling the Data Principal to access\nany virtual token that is issued by or\non behalf of the Data Fiduciary, is\nstored on the digital facility or\nplatform of such Data Fiduciary, and\nmay be used to get money, goods or\nservices.",
      "timePeriodText": "Three years from the date on\nwhich the Data Principal last\napproached the Data Fiduciary\nfor the performance of the\nspecified purpose or exercise of\nher rights, or the\ncommencement of the Digital\nPersonal Data Protection Rules,\n2025, whichever is latest.",
      "timePeriod": {
        "value": 3,
        "unit": "year",
        "triggerRule": "latest_of",
        "triggerEvents": [
          "Data Principal last approached Data Fiduciary for performance of specified purpose",
          "Data Principal last exercised rights",
          "commencement of DPDP Rules 2025"
        ]
      },
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:row:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleRow",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third",
      "rowNumber": 2,
      "dataFiduciaryClass": "Data Fiduciary who\nis an online gaming\nintermediary having\nnot less than fifty\nlakh registered users\nin India.",
      "purposeScope": "For all purposes, except for the following:\n(a) Enabling the Data Principal to\naccess her user account; and\n(b) Enabling the Data Principal to\naccess any virtual token that is\nissued by or on behalf of the Data\nFiduciary, is stored on the digital\nfacility or platform of such Data Fiduciary, and may be used to get\nmoney, goods or services.",
      "timePeriodText": "Three years from the date on\nwhich the Data Principal last\napproached the Data Fiduciary\nfor the performance of the\nspecified purpose or exercise of\nher rights, or the\ncommencement of the Digital\nPersonal Data Protection Rules,\n2025, whichever is latest.",
      "timePeriod": {
        "value": 3,
        "unit": "year",
        "triggerRule": "latest_of",
        "triggerEvents": [
          "Data Principal last approached Data Fiduciary for performance of specified purpose",
          "Data Principal last exercised rights",
          "commencement of DPDP Rules 2025"
        ]
      },
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:row:3",
      "@type": "dpdp:ScheduleRow",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third",
      "rowNumber": 3,
      "dataFiduciaryClass": "Data Fiduciary who\nis a social media\nintermediary having\nnot less than two\ncrore registered\nusers in India.",
      "purposeScope": "For all purposes, except for the following:\n(a) Enabling the Data Principal to\naccess her user account; and\n(b) Enabling the Data Principal to\naccess any virtual token that is\nissued by or on behalf of the Data\nFiduciary, is stored on the digital\nfacility or platform of such Data\nFiduciary, and may be used to get\nmoney, goods or services.",
      "timePeriodText": "Three years from the date on\nwhich the Data Principal last\napproached the Data Fiduciary\nfor the performance of the\nspecified purpose or exercise of\nher rights, or the\ncommencement of the Digital\nPersonal Data Protection Rules,\n2025, whichever is latest.",
      "timePeriod": {
        "value": 3,
        "unit": "year",
        "triggerRule": "latest_of",
        "triggerEvents": [
          "Data Principal last approached Data Fiduciary for performance of specified purpose",
          "Data Principal last exercised rights",
          "commencement of DPDP Rules 2025"
        ]
      },
      "crossReferences": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "@type": "dpdp:Interpretation",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third",
      "sourceText": "Note:In this Schedule, —\n(a) “e-commerce entity” means any person who owns, operates or manages a digital facility or\nplatform for e -commerce as defined in the Consumer Protection Act, 2019 (35 of 2019), but does\nnot include a seller offering her goods or services for sale on a marketplace e -commerce entity as\ndefined in the said Act;\n(b) “online gaming intermediary” means any intermediary who enables the users of its computer\nresource to access one or more online games;\n(c) “social media intermediary” means an intermediary as defined in clause (w) of sub-rule (1) of rule\n2 of the Information Technology (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Rules,\n2021; and\n(d) “user”, in relation to—\n(i) an e-commerce entity, means any person who accesses or avails any computer resource of\nan e-commerce entity; and\n(ii) an online gaming intermediary or a social media intermediary, means any person who\naccesses or avails of any computer resource of an intermediary for the purpose of hosting,\npublishing, sharing, transacting, viewing, displaying, downloading or uploading\ninformation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:note:clause:a",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(a)",
      "markerToken": "a",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 1,
      "sourceText": "“e-commerce entity” means any person who owns, operates or manages a digital facility or\nplatform for e -commerce as defined in the Consumer Protection Act, 2019 (35 of 2019), but does\nnot include a seller offering her goods or services for sale on a marketplace e -commerce entity as\ndefined in the said Act;",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:note:clause:b",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(b)",
      "markerToken": "b",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "sourceText": "“online gaming intermediary” means any intermediary who enables the users of its computer\nresource to access one or more online games;",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:note:clause:c",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(c)",
      "markerToken": "c",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 3,
      "sourceText": "“social media intermediary” means an intermediary as defined in clause (w) of sub-rule (1) of rule\n2 of the Information Technology (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Rules,\n2021; and",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:note:clause:d",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "provisionLevel": "clause",
      "marker": "(d)",
      "markerToken": "d",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 4,
      "sourceText": "“user”, in relation to—",
      "_has_children": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:note:clause:d:subclause:i",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third:note:clause:d",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "provisionLevel": "subclause",
      "marker": "(i)",
      "markerToken": "i",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 5,
      "sourceText": "an e-commerce entity, means any person who accesses or avails any computer resource of\nan e-commerce entity; and",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:third:note:clause:d:subclause:ii",
      "@type": "dpdp:LegalProvision",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:third:note:clause:d",
      "rootProvision": "rules:schedule:third:note",
      "provisionLevel": "subclause",
      "marker": "(ii)",
      "markerToken": "ii",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 6,
      "sourceText": "an online gaming intermediary or a social media intermediary, means any person who\naccesses or avails of any computer resource of an intermediary for the purpose of hosting,\npublishing, sharing, transacting, viewing, displaying, downloading or uploading\ninformation.",
      "_has_children": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a",
      "@type": "dpdp:SchedulePart",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth",
      "partLabel": "A",
      "legalEffect": "Act section 9(1) and 9(3) do not apply subject to stated conditions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a:row:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a",
      "rowNumber": 1,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to provision of health\nservices to the child by such establishment or\nprofessional, to the extent necessary for the\nprotection of her health.",
      "dataFiduciaryClass": "A Data Fiduciary who is a clinical\nestablishment, mental health establishment\nor healthcare professional."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a:row:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a",
      "rowNumber": 2,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to supporting implementation\nof any healthcare treatment and referral plan recommended by such professional for the child, to\nthe extent necessary for the protection of her health.",
      "dataFiduciaryClass": "A Data Fiduciary who is an allied\nhealthcare professional."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a:row:3",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a",
      "rowNumber": 3,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to tracking and behavioural\nmonitoring—\n(a) for the educational activities of such institution;\nor\n(b) in the interests of safety of children enrolled\nwith such institution.",
      "dataFiduciaryClass": "A Data Fiduciary who is an educational\ninstitution."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a:row:4",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a",
      "rowNumber": 4,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to tracking and behavioural\nmonitoring in the interests of safety of children\nentrusted in the care of such institution, crèche or\ncentre.",
      "dataFiduciaryClass": "A Data Fiduciary who is an individual in\nwhose care infants and children in a crèche\nor child day care centre are entrusted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a:row:5",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:a",
      "rowNumber": 5,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to tracking the location of\nsuch children, in the interests of their safety, during\nthe course of their travel to and from such institution,\ncrèche or centre.",
      "dataFiduciaryClass": "A Data Fiduciary who is engaged by an\neducational institution, crèche or child care\ncentre for transport of children enrolled\nwith such institution, crèche or centre."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b",
      "@type": "dpdp:SchedulePart",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth",
      "partLabel": "B",
      "legalEffect": "Act section 9(1) and 9(3) do not apply subject to stated conditions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b:row:1",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b",
      "rowNumber": 1,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to the extent necessary for\nsuch exercise, performance or discharge.",
      "purpose": "For the exercise of any power, performance\nof any function or discharge of any duties in\nthe interests of a child, under any law for the\ntime being in force in India."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b:row:2",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b",
      "rowNumber": 2,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to the extent necessary for\nsuch provision or issuance.",
      "purpose": "For providing or issuing of any subsidy,\nbenefit, service, certificate, licence or permit,\nby whatever name called, under law or policy\nor using public funds, in the interests of a\nchild, under clause (b) of section 7 of the Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b:row:3",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b",
      "rowNumber": 3,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to the extent necessary for\ncreating such user account, the use of which is\nlimited to communication by email.",
      "purpose": "For the creation of a user account for\ncommunicating by email."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b:row:4",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b",
      "rowNumber": 4,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to the tracking of real-time\nlocation of such child, in the interest of her safety\nand protection or security.",
      "purpose": "For the determination of real-time location of\na child."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b:row:5",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b",
      "rowNumber": 5,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to the extent necessary to\nensure that such information, service or\nadvertisement is not accessible to the child.",
      "purpose": "For ensuring that any information, service or\nadvertisement likely to cause any detrimental\neffect on the well-being of a child is not\naccessible to her."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b:row:6",
      "@type": "dpdp:ConditionalExemption",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth:part:b",
      "rowNumber": 6,
      "exempts": [
        "act:section:9:subsection:1",
        "act:section:9:subsection:3"
      ],
      "conditionText": "Processing is restricted to the extent necessary for\nsuch confirmation or observance.",
      "purpose": "For confirmation by the Data Fiduciary that\nthe Data Principal is not a child and\nobservance of due diligence under rule 10."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:fourth:note",
      "@type": "dpdp:Interpretation",
      "document": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "parent": "rules:schedule:fourth",
      "sourceText": "Note: In this Schedule, —\n(a) “advertisement” shall have the same meaning as is assigned to it in the Consumer Protection Act,\n2019 (35 of 2019).\n(a) “allied healthcare professional” shall have the same meaning as is assigned to it in the clause (d) of\nsection 2 of the National Commission for Allied and Healthcare Professions Act, 2021 (14 of 2021);\n(b) “clinical establishment” shall have the same meaning as assigned to it in the clause (c) of section 2\nof the Clinical Establishments (Registration and Regulation) Act, 2010 (23 of 2010);\n(c) “educational institution” shall mean and include an institution of learning that imparts education,\nincluding vocational education;\n(d) “healthcare professional” shall have the same meaning as is assigned to it in clause (j) of section 2\nof the National Commission for Allied and Healthcare Professions Act, 2021 (14 of 2021);\n(e) “health services” shall mean the services required to be provided by a healthcare professional as\nreferred to in clause (j) of section 2 of the National Commission for Allied and Healthcare Professions\nAct, 2021 (14 of 2021); and\n(f) “mental health establishment” shall have the same meaning as is assigned to it in clause (p) of sub-\nsection (1) of section 2 of the Mental Healthcare Act, 2017 (10 of 2017)."
    },
