      "order": 0,
      "sourceText": "The provisions of the Civil Service (Conduct) Rules,\n1964 shall apply to the officers and employees in like manner as applicable to a person appointed to a civil\nservice or post in connection with the affairs of the Union of India under the said rules.",
      "crossReferences": []
    },
