      "sourceDocument": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "sourceProvision": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:10",
      "sourceText": "The Consent Manager shall have in place measures to ensure that no conflict of interest arises on account of its directors, key managerial personnel and senior management holding a directorship, financial interest, employment or beneficial ownership in Data Fiduciaries, or having a material pecuniary relationship with them.",
