      "normalizedRequirementText": "consent manager shall have in place measures to ensure that no conflict of interest arises on account of its directors, key managerial personnel and senior management holding a directorship, financial interest, employment or beneficial ownership in Data Fiduciaries, or having a material pecuniary relationship with them."
    },
    {
      "@id": "rules:schedule:first:part:b:item:11:atomic:explicit:1",
