      "sourceDocument": "doc:dpdp-rules-2025",
      "sourceProvision": "rules:schedule:sixth:paragraph:1:subparagraph:1",
      "sourceText": "The Board may, in accordance with the Fundamental Rules and applicable guidelines issued by the Ministry of Personnel, Public Grievances and Pensions, Department of Personnel and Training, appoint officers and employees on deputation from the Central Government, a State Government, an autonomous body under the overall control of the Central Government or a State Government, a statutory body, or a public sector enterprise, for a period not exceeding five years.",
